    "name": "loss_contrastive_advantage_reciprocal",
    "intuition": "Shift from margin or energy paradigms to a contrastive probabilistic framework using reciprocal advantage signals, combining log-probability differences with inverted advantage gaps to penalize pairs where high log_prob_w and low advantage_gap conflict, using a softplus link encouraging contrastive separation.",
    "pseudocode": "adv_gap = batch['advantage_gap']\nl_diff = batch['log_prob_w'] - batch['log_prob_l']\ninv_adv = 1 / (abs(adv_gap) + epsilon)\nscore = l_diff * inv_adv\nloss = mean(weight * softplus(-score))",
